of the beech, (see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَانٌ</span>, latter sentence,) and therefore so called:] pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَانَاتٌ</span>. (Msb.) ＝   
